L41: ### Grouping
L42: 
L43: Downsample a time series with `group`. Supports `week` and `month`.
L44: 
L45:     `curl https://api.frankfurter.dev/v2/rates?from=2026-01-01&group=month`
L46: ### Filtering by Provider
L47: 
L48: Scope to specific providers with `providers`.
L49: 
L50:     `curl https://api.frankfurter.dev/v2/rates?providers=ecb`
L51: 
L52: By default, rates are blended across all providers. Use `providers` to get rates from a specific provider, or use 【14†provider routes】 to query a provider directly.
L53: ### Provider Attribution
L54: 
